Licensing notes for this repository

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the original work: the tools, benchmarks,
scripts, configuration and documents written for the project.

Patches are derivative works and keep the licence of what they modify:

* Linux kernel patches (kernel/patches/, kernel/experiments/,
  omarchy-arm64/kernel/): GPL-2.0, like the kernel.
* QEMU patches (virtualization/qemu/patches/qemu/): GPL-2.0, like QEMU.
* virglrenderer patches (virtualization/qemu/patches/virglrenderer/) and Mesa
  patches (omarchy-arm64/packages/mesa-virgl-video/patches/): MIT, like the
  components they change.
* Code that follows m1n1 (AsahiLinux/m1n1) says so in its header and keeps
  m1n1's licence; each native package in the Releases includes it as
  m1n1-LICENSE.

The Releases contain Linux kernel images built from the AsahiLinux/linux tree
at the commit named in README.md plus the patches above, with the kernel
configuration shipped alongside; the corresponding source is that tree and
this repository.
